mesa (26.3.0~devel20260929+rungic1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Base: upstream Mesa main 190d227a (2026-09-29) instead of the Mesa for
    Android container branch (docs/research/94). Carried for KGSL:
    - freedreno gallium KGSL backend (upstream's closed !21570 as the branch
      had it, with its later submit-lifetime fix);
    - KGSL dma-buf sharing, rewritten: imported buffers export as themselves,
      gralloc UBWC import on request (FD_KGSL_DMABUF_UBWC);
    - EGL/GBM on /dev/kgsl-3d0 with MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE=kgsl;
    - Turnip KGSL: VK_KHR_display on the instance, X11 DRI3 present.
    The branch's Termux changes (1274 for LINEAR, no xshmfence, Zink as the
    EGL default, DRI3 failure reported as success) are gone, and with them
    the need for two of the previous patches.

